{
  "name": "verinoda-live",
  "version": "0.6.0",
  "description": "Verinoda in Claude Code: keeps the code index fresh while Claude edits, checks each edit for names that do not exist, reviews commits, lists what could be changed for you to choose (/verinoda-improve), and shows it all in a Turkish pane with an animated mascot.",
